<title>USA: FelCor ups credit line to $550 mln.</title>
<headline>FelCor ups credit line to $550 mln.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said Monday that it has increased its unsecured revolving line of credit to $550 million from $400 million.</p>
<p>FelCor said it has also extended the maturity if its credit line for an additional year to September 30, 2000 and reduced the effective interest rate.</p>
<p>The line of credit will be used principally to fund FelCor's hotel acquisition programs, the company said.</p>
</text>
